{
  "id": "613",
  "title": "That’s Our Only Option",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-11-08",
  "synopsis": "Ben and Lucy want to grab something to eat on a Saturday at school.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/891/c489e5336e907ea630605df6764e1ceff5dc290a.mp3?1589791891",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 4: Trouble in Paradise",
    "chapter": 28,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "也只能这样了\n\n本：已经1点了。我们吃点东西吧！\n露西：好！但是今天是星期六，学校的食堂和咖啡店都不开门，怎么办？\n本：那我们去买点面包，在教室里吃吧。\n露西：好吧，也只能这样了。",
    "traditional": "也只能這樣了\n\n本：已經1點了。我們吃點東西吧！\n露西：好！但是今天是星期六，學校的食堂和咖啡店都不開門，怎麼辦？\n本：那我們去買點麵包，在教室裡吃吧。\n露西：好吧，也只能這樣了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "That’s Our Only Option"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：已经1点了。我们吃点东西吧！",
      "traditional": "本：已經1點了。我們吃點東西吧！",
      "pinyin": "běn yǐ jīng 1 diǎn le wǒ men chī diǎn dōng xi ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: It’s already 1 o'clock. Let’s eat something!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "露西：好！但是今天是星期六，学校的食堂和咖啡店都不开门，怎么办？",
      "traditional": "露西：好！但是今天是星期六，學校的食堂和咖啡店都不開門，怎麼辦？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī hǎo dàn shì jīn tiān shì xīng qī liù xué xiào de shí táng hé kā fēi diàn dōu bù kāi mén zěn me bàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Ok! But today is Saturday. The school canteen and cafe are both closed. What should we do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：那我们去买点面包，在教室里吃吧。",
      "traditional": "本：那我們去買點麵包，在教室裡吃吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà wǒ men qù mǎi diǎn miàn bāo zài jiào shì lǐ chī ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then let’s go buy some bread and eat it in the classroom."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "露西：好吧，也只能这样了。",
      "traditional": "露西：好吧，也只能這樣了。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī hǎo ba yě zhǐ néng zhè yàng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Alright, that’s our only option."
    }
  ],
